// Allstar-City: the Lost City shops (haggle pricing, stock-based prices, restocking) are replaced
// by Allstar-Scape's shops in content/scripts/allstar/shops. Lost City NPC scripts still call
// these two procs; they open nothing, because Allstar-Scape had no shop behind those NPC options.

[proc,openshop](inv $shop, int $shop_buy, int $shop_sell, int $shop_haggle, string $title)

[proc,openshop_activenpc]

// "Trade" on a shopkeeper whose option opened no shop in Allstar-Scape (no case in the packet 17
// chain, e.g. the spawned 527 Shop assistant, 793 Alfonse, 2620/2622 TzHaar merchants): nothing
// happens. The NPCs that had a shop get their own [opnpc3] trigger (allstar/generated/scripts).
[opnpc3,_shop_keeper]
